WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.168 --> 00:00:03.302
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:06.353
打开空白区域菜单 / Open the empty-area menu

3
00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:09.504
新建规则 / Create a Rule

4
00:00:09.504 --> 00:00:12.443
命名 Guide response and body / Name the Rule Guide response and body

5
00:00:12.443 --> 00:00:15.293
限制 Host 为 127.0.0.1 / Restrict Host to 127.0.0.1

6
00:00:15.293 --> 00:00:18.544
添加 Path 条件 / Add a Path condition

7
00:00:18.544 --> 00:00:21.392
限制本轮示例 Path / Restrict the example Path

8
00:00:21.392 --> 00:00:24.692
Header 选择 Response / Choose Response for the Header

9
00:00:24.692 --> 00:00:27.542
填写 x-guide-list / Enter x-guide-list

10
00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:30.740
选择 append / Choose append

11
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:33.643
追加值填 two / Enter the appended value two

12
00:00:33.643 --> 00:00:36.492
启用示例规则 / Enable the example Rule

13
00:00:36.492 --> 00:00:39.443
Apply 响应 append / Apply response append

14
00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:42.341
回到 Capture / Return to Capture

15
00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:45.190
重新请求 append / Send a new append request

16
00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:48.193
选择 append 请求 / Select the append request

17
00:00:48.193 --> 00:00:51.095
核对响应保留 one 并追加 two / Verify the response retains one and appends two

18
00:00:51.095 --> 00:00:54.092
返回原规则 / Return to the same Rule

19
00:00:54.092 --> 00:00:57.392
改为 remove / Switch to remove

20
00:00:57.392 --> 00:01:00.293
Apply 响应 remove / Apply response removal

21
00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:03.394
返回 Capture 核对移除 / Return to Capture to inspect removal

22
00:01:03.394 --> 00:01:06.293
重新请求 remove / Send a new remove request

23
00:01:06.293 --> 00:01:09.393
选择 remove 请求 / Select the remove request

24
00:01:09.393 --> 00:01:12.441
返回 Rules 编辑正文动作 / Return to Rules to edit the body action

25
00:01:12.441 --> 00:01:15.298
移除 Header 动作 / Remove the Header action

26
00:01:15.298 --> 00:01:18.594
添加 Body 动作 / Add a Body action

27
00:01:18.594 --> 00:01:21.893
Body 选择 Request / Choose Request for the Body

28
00:01:21.893 --> 00:01:24.740
填写 guide-final 正文 / Enter the guide-final body

29
00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:27.600
Apply 请求正文 / Apply request-body replacement

30
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.643
返回 Capture 观察正文 / Return to Capture to inspect the body

31
00:01:30.643 --> 00:01:33.545
发送 guide-original 的 POST / Send a POST containing guide-original

32
00:01:33.545 --> 00:01:36.396
选择 request-body 请求 / Select the request-body request

33
00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:39.696
Request 默认显示 Final / Request initially shows Final

34
00:01:39.696 --> 00:01:42.592
切换 Original / Switch to Original

35
00:01:42.592 --> 00:01:45.441
选择 Raw / Choose Raw

36
00:01:45.441 --> 00:01:48.343
复制 Original / Copy Original

37
00:01:48.343 --> 00:01:51.339
全屏查看 Original / View Original fullscreen

38
00:01:51.339 --> 00:01:54.430
Escape 返回详情 / Return to details with Escape

39
00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:57.333
再次切换 Final / Switch back to Final

40
00:01:57.333 --> 00:02:13.034
复制 Final / Copy Final

41
00:02:13.034 --> 00:02:17.201
保存 Final 为 guide-final.json / Save Final as guide-final.json

42
00:02:17.201 --> 00:02:19.961
确认保存的是 Final / Confirm the saved body is Final

43
00:02:19.961 --> 00:02:22.852
点击正文效果返回对应规则 / Follow the body effect to its Rule

44
00:02:22.852 --> 00:02:26.094
将 Body 改为 Response / Change the Body phase to Response

45
00:02:26.094 --> 00:02:28.924
填写 guide-response-final / Enter guide-response-final

46
00:02:28.924 --> 00:02:31.816
Apply 响应正文 / Apply response-body replacement

47
00:02:31.816 --> 00:02:34.793
返回 Capture 核对响应 / Return to Capture to inspect the response

48
00:02:34.793 --> 00:02:37.604
发送新的 response-body 请求 / Send a new response-body request

49
00:02:37.604 --> 00:02:40.483
选择 response-body 请求 / Select the response-body request

50
00:02:40.483 --> 00:02:43.477
核对响应 Original 不可用 / Verify response Original is unavailable

51
00:02:43.477 --> 00:02:46.353
返回产生响应的规则 / Return to the response writer Rule

52
00:02:46.353 --> 00:02:49.193
停用本轮规则 / Disable this example Rule

53
00:02:49.193 --> 00:02:52.081
Apply 停用状态 / Apply the disabled state

54
00:02:52.081 --> 00:02:55.116
返回 Capture 验证恢复 / Return to Capture to verify restoration

55
00:02:55.116 --> 00:02:58.472
发送新请求核对无改写 / Verify a new request is unmodified
